## Svelte 5 Runes Architecture

Lament uses **Svelte 5** across all frontend applications (`lament`, `lament-docs`, `lament-admin`). Components leverage Svelte 5 Runes for explicit reactivity.

### 1. Component Props with `$props()`

Props are declared using type-annotated destructuring:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  let { 
    title, 
    artist, 
    duration,
    isPlaying = false 
  }: { 
    title: string; 
    artist: string; 
    duration: number;
    isPlaying?: boolean;
  } = $props();
</script>
```

### 2. Local State with `$state()`

State variables are explicit and mutable without requiring `writable` stores:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  let currentTime = $state(0);
  let isMuted = $state(false);
</script>
```

### 3. Derived Computations with `$derived()`

Computed properties update automatically when dependencies change:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  let formattedTime = $derived(
    `${Math.floor(currentTime / 60)}:${String(Math.floor(currentTime % 60)).padStart(2, '0')}`
  );
</script>
```

---

## UI Component Library

UI primitives live in `src/lib/components/ui/` and are built using Tailwind CSS v4.

| Component | Path | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `Button` | `ui/Button.svelte` | Interactive button with primary, secondary, and ghost variants |
| `Badge` | `ui/Badge.svelte` | Status badges for format tags (e.g. `HLS`, `AAC`, `FLAC`) |
| `Logo` | `ui/Logo.svelte` | Scalable SVG branding mark |
| `Input` | `ui/Input.svelte` | Form input field with focus state styling |
| `Dialog` | `ui/Dialog.svelte` | Accessible modal overlay container |

---

## Iconography

Icons are imported from **Lucide Svelte**:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Play, Pause, SkipForward, Volume2 } from 'lucide-svelte';
</script>

<button class="p-2 text-text-primary hover:text-accent">
  <Play size={20} />
</button>
```

---

## Design System Integration

All components adhere to CSS tokens defined in `src/routes/layout.css`:

- **Colors**: `var(--color-accent)`, `var(--color-surface-1)`, `var(--color-text-primary)`
- **Border Radii**: `var(--radius-sm)`, `var(--radius-md)`, `var(--radius-lg)`
- **Animations**: `var(--transition-fast)`, `var(--transition-normal)`
